PART 2b -- THE INTRINSIC REMNANT AFTER THE IMF SIDE
  the LOOCV penalty: sqrt(E1_loocv^2 - E1_in^2) = 0.0436 dex in v vs the M/L lens 0.0472 dex -- the lens is the coherent, non-
  generalizing population systematic the proxies could NOT remove (G087's finding, now quantified).
  resolving the IMF (ATLAS3D-class) removes that coherent piece (-lens^2) and replaces it with the 0.015-dex residual:
  intr_remnant = sqrt(E1_loocv^2 - 0.047^2 + 0.015^2) = 0.0706 dex = 17.66%  [cross-check E1(in) = 0.0713 dex = 17.84% -- agree within 0.9%]
  conservative bound (no lens subtraction allowed): intr <= 0.0836 dex = 21.23%.
  the remnant sits ABOVE the RAR within-galaxy white-noise analogue 0.045-0.052 dex and ABOVE the errV noise floor 0.022 dex -> the residual is NOT yet at the galactic-disc noise floor: there is still a 1.4x gap to the floor-consistent regime.

